      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "You can reframe the small sample size as a strength by focusing on the *depth* of data collection per subject, rather than the breadth. Instead of emphasizing the number, highlight the comprehensive nature of the longitudinal tracking or the unique, high-resolution data gathered from each individual. You should assert that the intensive, in-depth nature of the analysis on these twelve subjects provides unparalleled mechanistic insight that larger, broader studies often miss. This strategic focus shifts the narrative from \"small\" to \"deeply examined.\"",
      "source": "target",
